4. **scikit-learn deprecation will break Task 6 at version 1.11** (Medium) — replace
   `SVC(probability=True)` with `CalibratedClassifierCV(SVC(), ensemble=False)` in
   `app/intelligence/ml/classification.py`; re-run the full build and confirm classification metrics stay
   comparable (report the before/after numbers — calibration can shift them).
5. **Two OpenMP runtimes coexist in one process** (Medium) — confirm `app/core/runtime.py`'s
   `prepare_dl_runtime()` guard genuinely prevents the XGBoost/PyTorch segfault (reproduce the crash
