   (infrastructure ready, not yet exercised on multiple races) — don't mark it fully done if it isn't.
7. **Deep learning is only ever compared on one race** (Medium) — same partial-closure treatment as #6;
   this is the same underlying limitation. Cross-reference the two entries in `todo-complete.md` rather than
   duplicating the explanation.

